  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Indonesia Institute - ODA Funded Programs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is to fund the Australia - Indonesia Institute&apos;s (AII) ODA eligible programs. This includes ODA eligible sections of the Australia Indonesia Youth Exchange Program (AIYEP), Australia Indonesia Muslim Exchange Program (AIMEP) and ODA eligible grants from the 2023-24 grant round. These programs are part of the AII&apos;s longstanding contribution to the important work of building bridges of understanding between Australia and Indonesia.</narrative>
  </description>
